OL,3,AFrench protests see numbers surge as
OL,4,Aunions join strikes over high cost of
OL,5,Aliving
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 600,000 protesters have taken
OL,8,Fpart in rallies and marches across
OL,9,FFrance, according to France's interior
OL,10,Fministry, with five unions joining a
OL,11,Fday of action demanding more money for
OL,12,Fwages and public services.
OL,14,FThe left-wing CGT union put the number
OL,15,Fof people taking part in Thursday's
OL,16,Fmobilisation at 1.57 million and hailed
OL,17,Fthe figure as "a level unmatched" since
OL,18,F2023, citing big protests in Paris,
OL,19,FMarseille, Bordeaux and Lille.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
